1.PC/Laptop won't power on
-------------------------------	
Possible Cause -Power adapter, battery, SMPS, RAM
Resolution - Check power cable, adapter, battery, reseat RAM, test with another adapter

2.Black screen	
-----------------------------
Possible Cause - Display driver, monitor, RAM, graphics card
Resolution - Check monitor, press Win + Ctrl + Shift + B, restart Explorer, boot to Safe 
             Mode,update/reinstall display driver
3.Slow performance
----------------------------
Possible Cause - Low disk space, startup apps, malware
Resolution - Disable startup apps, clean temporary files, scan for malware, upgrade SSD/RAM if needed

4.Windows freezes
--------------------------------
Driver issue, corrupt system files, overheating	Run sfc /scannow, DISM, update drivers, check CPU temperature
Possible Cause - Driver issue, corrupt system files, overheating
Resolution - Run sfc /scannow, DISM, update drivers, check CPU temperature

5.Blue Screen (BSOD)	
-------------------------
Possible Cause - Check error code, update drivers, run Windows Memory Diagnostic, chkdsk

6.Automatic restart	
---------------------------
Possible Cause - Hardware issue, overheating, PSU
Resolution - Check Event Viewer, CPU temperature, power supply

7.No internet	
-------------------------
Possible Cause - IP/DNS issue, cable, Wi-Fi
Resolution - Run ipconfig /release, ipconfig /renew, ipconfig /flushdns, restart router

8.Cannot join domain
-------------------------------
DNS, Active Directory, time mismatch	Verify DNS, sync time, rejoin the domain
Possible Cause - DNS, Active Directory, time mismatch
Resolution - Verify DNS, sync time, rejoin the domain

9.Login problem
------------------------------------
Password expired, account locked	
Possible Cause - Unlock account in Active Directory
Resolution -  reset password

10.Printer not printing	
--------------------------------------
Possible Cause - Driver, spooler, network issue
Resolution - Restart Print Spooler, reinstall printer, clear print queue

11.Shared folder not accessible	Permissions
-------------------------------------------------
Possible Cause - permission issue
Resolution - Check permissions, network connectivity, share settings

12.USB not detected	Driver,
------------------------------------------------------
USB port	Try another port, reinstall USB drivers
Possible Cause - Driver, USB port issue
Resolution - Try another port, reinstall USB drivers

13.Audio not working	
Possible Cause - Driver, disabled device	Check playback device
Resolution -   update audio driver

15.Outlook not opening	Corrupt profile, add-ins	
possible cause -  Corrupt profile, add-ins issue
Resolution - Start in Safe Mode, create a new Outlook profile

